# Line-ending policy for NeuroForge.
#
# The repository normalises all text to LF. This keeps gofmt, the Makefile,
# YAML manifests and shell scripts stable and is required for
# `make fmt-check` to pass.
#
# Binary artifacts are marked binary so they are never normalised or diffed.

# Default: text, normalised to LF on checkin/checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# LF-sensitive source and config.
*.go           text eol=lf
go.mod         text eol=lf
go.sum         text eol=lf
*.yaml         text eol=lf
*.yml          text eol=lf
*.md           text eol=lf
*.sh           text eol=lf
Makefile       text eol=lf
.editorconfig  text eol=lf
.gitignore     text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
LICENSE        text eol=lf

# Binary artifacts: never normalise, never diff.
*.dll  binary
*.pdb  binary
*.db   binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
